## 1. Executive Summary & System Architecture

### 1.1 Executive Summary
To address the $300B+ MSME credit gap in India, this system provides a production-grade, privacy-preserving mobile SDK that analyzes transactional SMS and UPI notifications locally on a borrower's Android device. By performing real-time parsing, classification, and financial feature aggregation on-device, the SDK constructs a comprehensive cash flow profile (monthly income, average daily balance, debt-to-income ratios) without uploading raw, sensitive SMS text to the cloud. 

This architecture guarantees compliance with India's Digital Personal Data Protection (DPDP) Act 2023 and RBI guidelines, while providing digital lenders with instant, high-fidelity alternative underwriting features.

### 1.2 System Architecture Diagram

```
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                     ON-DEVICE ANDROID SDK                                       |
|                                                                                                 |
