|                            | - Regex Engine            | <-> | - Raw SMS Metadata (Hashed)   |  |
|                            | - Tokenizer / Normalizer  |     | - Daily/Monthly Aggregates    |  |
|                            +---------------------------+     +-------------------------------+  |
